# MetaCurtis SST v3.0 - Director Pattern Implementation

## 🎭 Architecture Overview
```text
TheaterDirector (TIMING BRAIN)
├── Controls entire show timing
├── Emits signals via BeatBus
└── Coordinates all components

ConsciousnessTheater (ORCHESTRATOR)
├── Starts Director
├── Renders components
└── Manages user interaction

ConsciousnessEngine (BLUEPRINT BRAIN)
├── Builds particle blueprints
├── Responds to Director signals
└── Handles emergence mode

WebGLBackground (DUMB RENDERER)
├── Renders blueprints
├── Confirms particle settlement
└── No logic, just rendering

Flow: Director → BeatBus → Components → User Experience